# The champion with the turtle armed (turtle 85, riposte 0): a one-shot
# read at sample 1,500 of our worth against the strongest rival's, and
# at or below 85 percent the army holds home for the rest of the match
# -- no wave releases on size, the reserve gathers under the guard and
# the anti-air, and only a forced release lets it out; with riposte off
# the forced releases left are the all-in and the strike, both zero
# here, so this arm holds without ever counter-punching. Built from the
# certified 96-game corpus (very-hard-race, log 2026-09-13): a Very Hard
# loss is the field fight lost between samples 1,500 and 2,500 against
# an army the enemy's weighted-random opening rolled larger, losers
# dying to the mobile army in the field before they reach the base,
# and worth/rival at 1,500 rank-AUCs 0.79 for that loss. The press,
# the same read at 2,000 with the opposite response, read -4 on 48
# pairs (pressvh48). Every other knob and every goals slot is the
# champion's exactly.
name evolve1-g4m2-turtle85
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
